274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (The analysis of category preferences across customer segments highlights a structural difference between the categories that drive purchase frequency and those that generate the highest revenue. In particular, while Health Science & Nutrition Add-ons accounts for the largest portion of revenue, Beverages is the most frequently purchased category across all customer segments, followed by Dairy & Nutrition, which also represents a significant share of total purchases. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
