/Title (The probability alive matrix indicates that customers with both high purchase frequency and recent transactions have the strongest probability of being active. In contrast, this probability decreases as the time since the last purchase increases, even among customers with a significant number of past orders. Therefore, recency emerges as a significant predictor of customer activity, as individuals with fewer purchases may still have a high probability of being active if they have purchased recently.)
