/Title (The comparison between active and churned customers does not reveal substantial differences in segment composition. The Value segment accounts for approximately 40% of customers in both groups, followed by the Mainstream segment at around 35%. Instead, Premium and Health-focused customers represent smaller shares, even though their proportions remain similar across active and churned customers.)
